{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 19:47:41.009291", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content='Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Health Overview:\\nThe network is an SDN star topology with one central switch (switch_0) and multiple edge switches (switch_1 to switch_8). Hosts are connected to edge switches, and all devices share a single access subnet (10.0.0.0/24). The management/control network (20.0.0.0/24) is used for OpenFlow communication with the SDN controller at 20.0.0.100.\\n\\n#### Findings:\\n1. **Reachability Results:**\\n   - **Host-to-Host Communication:**\\n     - Most hosts successfully communicate with each other, with no packet loss and reasonable round-trip times (RTTs).\\n     - RTTs are generally consistent, averaging around 40-43 ms, with minimal deviation.\\n   - **Anomalies:**\\n     - Host_2 is unable to communicate with Host_6 and Host_3. The status for these tests is marked as \"unknown,\" indicating a potential issue with Host_2 or its connectivity to the network.\\n\\n2. **Performance Metrics:**\\n   - RTTs for successful communications are within acceptable ranges, with average values between 39 ms and 43 ms.\\n   - RTT deviations (mdev) are slightly high, ranging from 38 ms to 43 ms, which may indicate some variability in network performance.\\n\\n3. **Packet Loss:**\\n   - No packet loss was observed in successful communications, suggesting that the network paths for these hosts are functioning correctly.\\n\\n#### Abnormal Behavior:\\n- **Host_2 Connectivity Issue:**\\n  - Host_2 is unable to establish communication with Host_6 and Host_3. This could be due to:\\n    - A misconfiguration or failure in the edge switch (switch_2) connected to Host_2.\\n    - Issues with Host_2\\'s network interface or IP configuration.\\n    - Problems with the central switch (switch_0) or the SDN controller affecting specific paths.\\n\\n#### Next Steps:\\nFurther investigation is required to pinpoint the root cause of Host_2\\'s connectivity issue. This may involve examining the network configuration of Host_2, switch_2, and the central switch (switch_0), as well as verifying the SDN controller\\'s operation.\\n\\nThis concludes the diagnostic report., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='55a35532-349f-44bf-a295-d99c35f1a8b1'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
